  "doctrine": "NC prep. Low-pressure wash only (NEVER power wash — damages panel edges, forces water through vents). Wood: 80-120 grit sand. FC: 150-grit scuff. Vinyl: 220-grit scuff (mandatory for bonding primer adhesion). Tannin spot-prime is a heuristic at 1200 SF/hr (5 min per 100 SF on bare cedar/redwood/fir — not counted individually). No end-seal (construction task). Caulk panel joints + fascia/frieze junctions. Open-face modifier (2.0x) applies to all tasks. All overhead rates baked in."
